          },
          {
            "name": "order",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**\n实时会话统计排序方式。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**\n- ASC:根据order_field值升序。\n- DESC:根据order_field值降序。\n\n**默认取值**\nASC",
            "enum": [
              "ASC",
              "DESC"
            ],
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "ASC",
            "required": false
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
